  "description": "The components of the META V5 SIGNATURE were chosen for their efficiency and to enhance the qualities of the frame itself.\n• The FOX 36 Float Factory fork offers the best from the brand: Kashima coated anti-friction stanchions and Grip X2 cartridge with differentiated hydraulic adjustments.The Float X Factory shock is adapted to the kinematics of the frame and contributes to the dynamism of the bike. Different hydraulic adjustments allow you to adapt to the terrain. A lock-out lever makes climbing more efficient.\n• TRP DH-R EVO PRO 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs are progressive and consistent.\n• The DT SWISS EX 1700 wheelset is made with high-quality aluminium and feature an ultra-strong welded rim. They are assembled by hand in Switzerland.\n• A SRAM GX Eagle T-Type 12-speed group is super modern, efficient, and virtually indestructible.",
